    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d47">

                <pb facs="0113" n="97" sameAs="frus:frus1902app1/pg97"/>

                <head>EXHIBIT F F.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2218.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Asiatic Department</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                        1882</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Chargé d’Affaires</hi>: In reply to the note
                    which you had the goodness to address me on May 13/25 relative to fishing and
                    hunting in our waters of the Pacific, and in which you have expressed a desire
                    to have a translation of the articles of our Code which govern the subject, I
                    have the honor to send you herewith the translation of articles 560 et sequitur
                    of the Code T. XII, part 2.</p>
                <p>Please to accept, Mr. Chargé d’Affaires, the assurance of my distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Giers</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>To Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Hoffman</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires, etc.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d47-a1.xml" xpointer="d47-a1"/>
